---
description: Cursor-specific reminders for the shared Universal Coding Agent Kit
alwaysApply: true
---

The project's shared engineering instructions are in the root `AGENTS.md`; follow those rather than maintaining a conflicting second rule set.

Before a substantial coding task, open `.agents/AGENTS.md` and only the relevant skill file under `.agents/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`. If Cursor's current version does not automatically discover a skill, add that exact file as context explicitly; do not claim automatic skill loading unless it is visible in Cursor's active context.

Use Cursor-supported context, tools, and agent workflows. The definitions under `.opencode/agents/` are OpenCode-specific and are not assumed to work in Cursor.